 "hints": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": [
   "Store per user only the current level and the time of the last applied refill.",
   "The number of refills due at time t is floor((t - last) / interval); apply them together and cap at the maximum.",
   "Advance last by whole intervals only, so the refill phase stays anchored to the policy time."
  ],
